          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਖਿਸਕਣਾ — khisakṇā — \"to slide; to slip away\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਮੀਂਹ ਵਿੱਚ ਪਹਾੜ ਤੋਂ ਪੱਥਰ ਖਿਸਕਦੇ ਹਨ। mīṁh vich pahāṛ ton patthar khisakde han. In the rain, stones slide down from the mountain."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): ਉਹ ਪੱਥਰ ਖਿਸਕਿਆ, oh patthar khiskiā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
