          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ਖਿਸਕਣਾ (khisakṇā) is inherited from a reconstructed khis, \"slip\"; CDIAL lists Punjabi khiskaṇā, \"to slip away\", under it (CDIAL 3888)."
            }
          ]
